# Keep internal working docs out of the public deploy.
#
# The repo root IS the deploy root (static, no build step), so anything tracked
# here is served at amparohq.com/<path> unless excluded. These directories hold
# strategy notes, funnel numbers, unresolved legal-exposure notes, and battle
# plans — none of it is site content and none of it is linked from any route.
#
# Verified before excluding (2026-08-20): no href/src in index.html, app/ or
# arena/ references any of these, and none appear as a path in sitemap.xml.
# Live routes are: /, /about, /acerca, /como-verificamos, /derechos,
# /how-we-verify, /rights, plus /app and /arena.

notebook/
tasks/
wargames/

